### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 2. Create Workspace
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Task Test Workspace"
}

### 3. Create Project
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Task Test Project"
}

### 4. Create Board
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Task Board"
}

### 5. Create Columns (Backlog, To Do, In Progress, Done)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Backlog"
}

POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "To Do"
}

POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "In Progress"
}

POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "name": "Done"
}

### 6. Create Task
# @name createTask
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Implement authentication",
  "description": "Add JWT auth with refresh tokens",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "dueDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 7. Create More Tasks
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Design database schema",
  "priority": "URGENT"
}

POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Create API endpoints",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### 8. Get All Tasks in Column
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 9. Get All Tasks in Board
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/board/YOUR_BOARD_ID/tasks
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 10. Get Task by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/YOUR_TASK_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 11. Update Task
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/YOUR_TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "title": "Implement JWT authentication",
  "priority": "URGENT"
}

### 12. Move Task to Different Column
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/YOUR_TASK_ID/move
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "columnId": "TARGET_COLUMN_ID",
  "position": 0
}

### 13. Get My Assigned Tasks
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/my-tasks
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 14. Reorder Tasks in Column
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/column/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/reorder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "taskIds": ["TASK_ID_2", "TASK_ID_1", "TASK_ID_3"]
}

### 15. Delete Task (Archive)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/YOUR_TASK_ID
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 16. Permanently Delete Task
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/projects/YOUR_PROJECT_ID/boards/YOUR_BOARD_ID/columns/YOUR_COLUMN_ID/tasks/YOUR_TASK_ID?permanent=true
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN




# 1. Restart the server
npx ts-node src/server.ts

